# EN: Optional: validation of Cloudflare Access JWTs.
#     Configure all three variables or leave them all commented out.
#     Add the public hostname chosen for Actions here.
# IT: Opzionale: validazione dei JWT Cloudflare Access.
#     Configurare tutte e tre le variabili oppure lasciarle commentate.
#     Aggiungere qui il nome pubblico scelto per Actions.
PROXY_ALLOWED_HOSTS=localhost,127.0.0.1
# CLOUDFLARE_ACCESS_TEAM_DOMAIN=https://your-team.cloudflareaccess.com
# CLOUDFLARE_ACCESS_AUD=replace-with-access-application-audience
# CLOUDFLARE_ACCESS_EMAILS=user@example.com
